### ============================================
### PQRS SERVICE - Pruebas de endpoints (vía API Gateway)
### Puerto interno: 3010 | Prefijo gateway: /api/v1/pqrs -> /api/v1/pqrs
### Base de datos: uajs_pqrs (pqrs, pqrs_types, pqrs_statuses, pqrs_responses,
### pqrs_attachments, pqrs_audit_trail)
### Flujo: pending -> in_review -> responded -> closed
### ============================================

@gateway = http://localhost:3000
@direct = http://localhost:3010
@contentType = application/json
@adminEmail = evidencia.qa@uajs.edu
@adminPassword = EvidenciaQA.2026
@campusUuid = PEGA_UUID_DE_LA_SEDE_PRINCIPAL
@ticketNumber = PQRS-2026-000001
@fileId = 1

### ============================================
### PREREQUISITOS
### 1) SUPERADMIN asignado (ver user-service.http) y LOGIN ejecutado.
### 2) Tipos semilla: PETICION, QUEJA, RECLAMO, SUGERENCIA, FELICITACION (SLA 15 días).
### 3) UUID de la sede: SELECT uuid FROM uajs_academic.campuses WHERE is_main = 1;
### 4) @ticketNumber: el número que devuelve la radicación (campo ticket_number).
### ============================================

### HEALTH CHECK
GET {{direct}}/api/v1/pqrs/health

### LOGIN
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ============================================
### TIPOS DE PQRS  (pqrs_types)
### ============================================

### Listar tipos (semilla) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/tipos?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Crear tipo de prueba -> 201
# @name createTipo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/tipos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "QA_TIPO",
  "name": "Tipo QA",
  "description": "Tipo de PQRS para pruebas",
  "slaDays": 10
}

### Actualizar SLA -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/tipos/{{createTipo.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "slaDays": 12
}

### ============================================
### ESTADOS  (pqrs_statuses, semilla)
### ============================================

GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/estados?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### PQRS  (pqrs)
### Nota: la radicación exige autenticación aunque la PQRS sea anónima.
### ============================================

### Radicar PQRS identificada -> 201 (ticket PQRS-AAAA-NNNNNN, due_date = hoy + SLA)
# @name createPqrs
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "typeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "subject": "Queja de prueba QA",
  "description": "Descripción detallada de la queja de prueba",
  "isAnonymous": false,
  "contactEmail": "qa@uajs.edu.co",
  "campusUuid": "{{campusUuid}}",
  "campusName": "Sede Principal"
}

### Radicar PQRS anónima -> 201 (requester_uuid y requester_name quedan en NULL)
# @name createPqrsAnonima
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "typeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "subject": "Sugerencia anónima QA",
  "description": "Propuesta enviada sin identificación",
  "isAnonymous": true
}

### Asunto demasiado corto -> 400 (min 3)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "typeId": {{createTipo.response.body.data.id}},
  "subject": "ab",
  "description": "Descripción válida"
}

### Listar PQRS (filtros statusId, typeId, assigneeUuid) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs?page=1&limit=10&statusId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Rastrear por número de radicado -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/rastrear/{{ticketNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Obtener PQRS -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Pasar a revisión (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/en-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Responder oficialmente (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/responder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "Respuesta oficial de prueba QA"
}

### Respuesta demasiado corta -> 400 (min 3)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/responder
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "body": "ab"
}

### Respuestas de la PQRS -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/respuestas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Cerrar (ADMIN) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/cerrar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Historial de transiciones -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### ADJUNTOS  (pqrs_attachments -> storage)
### fileId: id devuelto al subir el archivo en storage-service.http
### ============================================

### Adjuntar archivo -> 201
# @name createAdjunto
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fileId": {{fileId}}
}

### Listar adjuntos -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Eliminar adjunto -> 200
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/{{createPqrs.response.body.data.id}}/adjuntos/{{createAdjunto.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### LIMPIEZA
### Las PQRS tienen auditoría y no se borran. Solo se elimina el tipo de prueba
### si no tiene PQRS asociadas.
### ============================================
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/pqrs/tipos/{{createTipo.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### VERIFICACIÓN EN BD
### SELECT id, ticket_number, is_anonymous, requester_uuid, due_date, status_id FROM uajs_pqrs.pqrs ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 5;
### SELECT pqrs_id, from_status_id, to_status_id, actor_name FROM uajs_pqrs.pqrs_audit_trail ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;
### ============================================
